# Lines NoWayOS's tools/qemu-test must see, in this order: the
# heartbeat starts, the looper starts looping after the third beat, and with
# its budget below its period the heartbeat below it keeps its time - every
# beat on time, none late.
NOWAYOS: budget-probe: heartbeat: beating every 100 ms
NOWAYOS: budget-probe: heartbeat: beat 3: on time
NOWAYOS: budget-probe: looper: looping from now on
NOWAYOS: budget-probe: heartbeat: beat 4: on time
NOWAYOS: budget-probe: heartbeat: beat 10: on time
NOWAYOS: budget-probe: heartbeat: beat 20: on time
NOWAYOS: budget-probe: heartbeat: 20 beats, every one on time

!MON|ERROR
!seL4(CPU
!panicked
!gave up
!late by
